        "content": "\n| Gap Type | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| **Race Condition** | Concurrent getCsrfToken calls |\n| **Error Handling** | Server returns ok: false |\n| **Error Handling** | Network failure |\n| **Security** | Cookie setting validation |\n| **Edge Case** | clearCsrfToken during active fetch |\n| **Integration** | document.cookie in Node environment |\n\n",
